sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as opendatahub-operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AIGW as ai-gateway-operator<br/>SA: ai-gateway-operator
    participant BGW as batch-gateway-operator<br/>(Sub-Component)
    participant MaaS as maas-controller<br/>(Sub-Component)

    Note over Platform,MaaS: Flow 1: AIGateway Reconciliation (Sub-Component Deployment)

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create AIGateway CR<br/>(default-aigateway)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>AIGW: Watch event: AIGateway created
    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Read DSCI (monitoring NS)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>AIGW: DSCI config

    alt batchGateway.managementState == Managed
        AIGW->>K8sAPI: SSA: CRDs, RBAC, Deployment<br/>(batch-gateway-operator)<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>BGW: Deployment created
        AIGW->>K8sAPI: Read Deployment status<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>AIGW: Deployment Ready
    end

    alt modelsAsAService.managementState == Managed
        AIGW->>K8sAPI: SSA: CRDs, RBAC, Deployment,<br/>Webhook (maas-controller)<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>MaaS: Deployment created
        AIGW->>K8sAPI: Read Deployment status<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>AIGW: Deployment Ready
    end

    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway status<br/>(per-sub-module conditions)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Read odh-aigateway-config<br/>(platformVersion handshake)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Update status.releases<br/>(echo platformVersion)<br/>Auth: SA Token

    Note over Platform,MaaS: Flow 2: MaaS Clean Removal (Teardown Handshake)

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway CR<br/>modelsAsAService.managementState: Removed<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>AIGW: Watch event: spec changed
    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Annotate maas-controller Deployment<br/>teardown-requested: true<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>MaaS: Annotation update

    MaaS->>MaaS: Disable self-heal
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Delete Config/default CR<br/>Clean runtime resources<br/>Auth: SA Token
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Annotate Deployment<br/>teardown-completed: true<br/>Auth: SA Token

    loop Poll for teardown-completed
        AIGW->>K8sAPI: Read maas-controller Deployment<br/>Auth: SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>AIGW: Check annotations
    end

    AIGW->>K8sAPI: GC maas-controller bundle<br/>(Deployments, RBAC, CRDs)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    Note over AIGW: Preserves infra namespace<br/>and maas-db-config secret
    AIGW->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway status<br/>Auth: SA Token
